{"id":"n69580-6-5","stage":2,"title":"살리다 · 救活","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69580-6-5-1","ko":"회사를 살릴 방법은 정말 없는 거야?","zh":"真的就没有办法挽救公司了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회사를","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사를","audio":"/audio/62f80adf2dcac5e0aace.mp3"}},{"text":"살릴","meaning":"救活，修好，拯救","explanation":"살리다：救活，修好，拯救；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"살리다","audio":"/audio/9bae822528cf3c280f59.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69580","senseId":"6","lemma":"살리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살릴","audio":"/audio/f67a982bedc14d440226.mp3"}},{"text":"방법은","meaning":"方法，办法","explanation":"방법：方法，办法；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"방법","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65531","senseId":"1","lemma":"방법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방법은","audio":"/audio/db18c55957df95e609a3.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"2","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는","audio":"/audio/9064a5c0bfdea4101ee3.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entr